@startuml state-order
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fafafa
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Order — State Machine

[*] --> PLACED : Customer places order (CUS-01)

PLACED --> CONFIRMED : [auto] merchant confirms (MER-01 sim)
PLACED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels (CUS-06)

CONFIRMED --> READY : [auto] merchant declares ready (MER-02 sim)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels (CUS-06)

READY --> DISPATCHING : Order publishes OrderReady;\ndispatch starts
READY --> CANCELLED : customer cancels (CUS-06)

DISPATCHING --> IN_PROGRESS : courier marks pickup (COU-04)\n→ Delivery: PICKED_UP
DISPATCHING --> CANCELLED : customer cancels (CUS-06)\n[before pickup]

IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : courier marks delivery (COU-04)\n→ Delivery: DELIVERED

COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

DISPATCHING : if no candidate remains: alert to operator (SYS-04)
DISPATCHING : order stays DISPATCHING in V1

note right of DISPATCHING
  Covers two sub-phases:
  · Delivery PENDING — looking for a courier
  · Delivery ASSIGNED — courier confirmed,
    not yet at the pickup point
  Cancellation is allowed in both sub-phases
  (before pickup only).
end note

note right of CANCELLED
  Payment refund logic:
  defined in payment design (phase 0.3).
end note
@enduml
